# `dist/` is versioned on purpose — see .gitattributes and CLAUDE.md.
# pnpm 11 blocks install scripts of packages coming from git, and the
# authorization key includes the commit SHA, which changes on every tag. Shipping
# the build ready-made is what makes the git dependency usable on Vercel, on
# Railway and in CI.

